-I'll get the car. Yeah.


01:23:51.604 --> 01:23:52.772
Watch over him.


01:23:59.478 --> 01:24:00.613
What happened?


01:24:00.647 --> 01:24:01.781
I'm here.


01:24:05.217 --> 01:24:07.052
Slim! Smoke!


01:24:10.289 --> 01:24:11.524
Where the hell
you been at, man?


01:24:12.625 --> 01:24:13.560
Huh?


01:24:15.528 --> 01:24:19.599
To go see a man about a dog,
like I told ya, you old drunk.


01:24:19.632 --> 01:24:21.701
Turns out
I need to take a shit, too.


01:24:25.672 --> 01:24:27.840
God dog! What happened
to you, Smoke?


01:24:29.441 --> 01:24:31.376
Stack dead.


01:24:31.410 --> 01:24:33.078
Nigga, what the fuck
happened to you?


01:24:35.548 --> 01:24:36.549
I'm sorry.


01:24:38.150 --> 01:24:40.085
All right, well, let me in,
so I can help.


01:24:40.687 --> 01:24:41.721
Hold on.


01:24:44.156 --> 01:24:45.457
What y'all doin'?


01:24:45.490 --> 01:24:47.225
Just step aside
and let me on in, now.


01:24:48.561 --> 01:24:49.762
Why you need him to do that?


01:24:52.665 --> 01:24:55.133
You big and strong enough
to push past us.


01:24:55.167 --> 01:24:56.501
Well, that wouldn't be
too polite,


01:24:56.536 --> 01:24:58.403
now, would it, Miss Annie?


01:24:59.772 --> 01:25:01.541
I don't know why
I'm talking to you anyway.


01:25:01.574 --> 01:25:02.842
Probably your fish sandwich


01:25:02.875 --> 01:25:04.677
messed up my guts
in the first place.


01:25:04.711 --> 01:25:06.445
Usin' old, stale grease.


01:25:06.478 --> 01:25:07.880
I ain't never used
stale grease,
and you know it.


01:25:07.914 --> 01:25:09.181
Shut up, Annie. Smoke...


01:25:09.214 --> 01:25:10.248
Don't talk to him.


01:25:10.282 --> 01:25:11.483
You talkin' to me right now.


01:25:11.517 --> 01:25:13.218
Why you can't just
walk your big ass


01:25:13.251 --> 01:25:14.520
up in here
without an invite, huh?


01:25:16.589 --> 01:25:17.690
Go 'head.


01:25:17.724 --> 01:25:19.525
Admit to it.


01:25:19.559 --> 01:25:20.593
Admit to what?


01:25:21.594 --> 01:25:23.428
That you dead.


01:25:23.462 --> 01:25:25.464
That one of them white folks
out there kill you,


01:25:25.497 --> 01:25:26.666
and you a haint now.


01:25:32.739 --> 01:25:34.574
Smoke, you listenin' to this?


01:25:36.542 --> 01:25:39.244
Woman, this man
showed me kindness.


01:25:39.277 --> 01:25:41.948
Employed me.
Grabbed me out the field.


01:25:41.981 --> 01:25:43.583
Now, he say
his brother been killed.


01:25:43.616 --> 01:25:44.717
The man needs comfort,


01:25:44.751 --> 01:25:46.619
not you fillin' up his mind


01:25:46.653 --> 01:25:49.722
with that old Lousiana bayou
bullshit you on.


01:25:49.756 --> 01:25:52.391
Now, we out here playing games,


01:25:52.424 --> 01:25:53.860
telling ghost stories


01:25:53.893 --> 01:25:56.228
in place of doin'
what we ought to do.


01:25:58.631 --> 01:26:00.365
And what is it
we s'pose to be doin'?


01:26:02.267 --> 01:26:03.836
Bein' kind to one another!


01:26:04.704 --> 01:26:05.938
And bein' polite.


01:26:05.972 --> 01:26:08.206
Now, we is one peoples.


01:26:08.240 --> 01:26:09.909
And we shouldn't go in,


01:26:09.942 --> 01:26:12.545
bargin' into other folks'
places uninvited.


01:26:12.578 --> 01:26:13.646
So...


01:26:16.516 --> 01:26:17.950
You been in and outta here
all day.


01:26:17.984 --> 01:26:20.318
Ain't never need
an invite then.


01:26:21.453 --> 01:26:22.555
Yeah,


01:26:22.588 --> 01:26:24.757
somethin' ain't addin' up.


01:26:24.791 --> 01:26:27.325
Shit, Stack was
my ride up here.


01:26:27.359 --> 01:26:28.393
I 'posed to walk back?


01:26:28.427 --> 01:26:29.996
That ain't my problem.


01:26:31.564 --> 01:26:34.266
Well, it be, your own peoples.


01:26:34.299 --> 01:26:35.768
And I thought
you was better than this,


01:26:35.802 --> 01:26:37.302
but you just like
the white man.


01:26:41.473 --> 01:26:42.775
Can I at least get my money?


01:26:42.809 --> 01:26:44.610
You did such a bang-up job...


01:26:44.644 --> 01:26:46.378
now you wanna get paid
for what you ain't did?


01:26:46.411 --> 01:26:47.747
Ain't nobody talkin' to you,
you old drunk.


01:26:47.780 --> 01:26:49.515
-Shut your mouth.
-No, you shut the fuck up.


01:26:49.549 --> 01:26:51.784
Don't give him shit, Smoke.
Don't give him nothin'.


01:26:55.320 --> 01:26:56.321
Careful.


01:27:10.737 --> 01:27:12.772
Smoke! Smoke!


01:27:14.040 --> 01:27:15.641
- Oh, no!
- Smoke!


01:27:35.027 --> 01:27:36.662
Close it!
Close the door!


01:27:36.696 --> 01:27:38.865
Close the door!
What the fuck? What the fuck?


01:27:38.898 --> 01:27:40.633
He got you? Did he get you?


01:27:40.666 --> 01:27:42.034
I'm all right,
I'm all right, I'm all right.


01:27:42.068 --> 01:27:43.301
- What the hell was that?
- I don't know.


01:27:43.335 --> 01:27:44.670
Hey. Hey.


01:27:46.839 --> 01:27:47.940
Y'all smell anything?


01:27:48.841 --> 01:27:50.676
No.


01:27:50.710 --> 01:27:52.410
I think I shat myself.


01:27:54.580 --> 01:27:56.082
Huh...


01:27:56.115 --> 01:27:57.817
How the hell he get up, huh?


01:27:57.850 --> 01:27:59.051
I don't know.
I don't know.


01:27:59.085 --> 01:28:01.319
I shot the nigga
in his head.


01:28:01.353 --> 01:28:02.287
- Cornbread pulled me
out the goddamn door.


01:28:03.890 --> 01:28:05.357
Is someone in there?


01:28:13.866 --> 01:28:14.967
Smoke.


01:28:15.001 --> 01:28:16.035
Smoke!


01:28:16.836 --> 01:28:17.837
Smoke?


01:28:19.138 --> 01:28:20.673
Go on ahead.


01:28:20.706 --> 01:28:21.941
Open up this door,
let me on out of here.


01:28:30.650 --> 01:28:31.684
Stack...


01:28:32.885 --> 01:28:33.853
Nigga, that's you?


01:28:33.886 --> 01:28:35.487
Nah, fool, it's Jim Crow.


01:28:35.521 --> 01:28:37.023
Nigga, of course it's me.
Open the door.


01:28:37.890 --> 01:28:38.891
Stack...


01:28:42.895 --> 01:28:44.931
How...
How you feelin'?


01:28:46.431 --> 01:28:47.800
Boy, you lost a lot of blood.


01:28:48.901 --> 01:28:49.936
Oh, yeah.


01:28:50.870 --> 01:28:51.771
Yeah.


01:28:56.474 --> 01:28:58.945
It was scary,
and I'm doing much better now.


01:28:58.978 --> 01:29:01.547
I swear. On Mama grave.


01:29:01.581 --> 01:29:03.415
I thought you said
he was dead.


01:29:03.448 --> 01:29:04.517
He was.


01:29:04.550 --> 01:29:06.786
I checked his pulse.


01:29:06.819 --> 01:29:08.855
Then what the fuck
is he doin' talkin' to us?


01:29:08.888 --> 01:29:10.089
But this is good, right?


01:29:10.122 --> 01:29:11.891
Means he's okay.


01:29:12.859 --> 01:29:13.860
Smoke...


01:29:15.661 --> 01:29:17.029
that ain't your brother.


01:29:17.063 --> 01:29:18.698
Smoke, what that witch
out there talkin' 'bout?


01:29:18.731 --> 01:29:20.800
You gonna let her
get in between us again?


01:29:20.833 --> 01:29:21.901
What we been through...


01:29:21.934 --> 01:29:23.569
German trenches, nigga.


01:29:23.603 --> 01:29:24.937
Chicago gangways.


01:29:26.739 --> 01:29:28.007
Oh, all right.


01:29:28.040 --> 01:29:29.876
Y'all niggas gonna pay
for this shit.


01:29:29.909 --> 01:29:32.144
Lockin' this pimp
in the closet, huh?


01:29:32.178 --> 01:29:33.746
Huh? Open the door, Smoke!


01:29:33.779 --> 01:29:35.181
Let me the fuck out
or I swear before God,


01:29:35.214 --> 01:29:37.583
I'm layin' all you
sons of bitches down.


01:29:37.617 --> 01:29:38.951
One by one!


01:29:43.055 --> 01:29:44.557
Smoke.


01:29:44.590 --> 01:29:46.959
Come on, man.
Open the door, it's me.


01:29:46.993 --> 01:29:48.728
You know
I don't like this shit, man.


01:29:48.761 --> 01:29:50.630
Please, Smoke,
let me out of this room.


01:29:50.663 --> 01:29:51.697
Smoke, please.


01:29:54.800 --> 01:29:55.935
Annie, give me the key.


01:29:57.069 --> 01:29:58.104
Stack?


01:30:09.615 --> 01:30:10.616
Stop!


01:30:13.085 --> 01:30:14.086
Hey!


01:30:15.487 --> 01:30:16.488
Sammie!


01:30:19.191 --> 01:30:20.626
Come on, get up.


01:30:24.130 --> 01:30:25.831
What was in the jar?


01:30:25.865 --> 01:30:26.933
Pickled garlic.


01:30:28.534 --> 01:30:29.635
These ain't haints.


01:30:30.736 --> 01:30:31.737
They're vampires.


01:30:36.175 --> 01:30:39.111
Bo's out there.
We gotta go get him.


01:30:39.145 --> 01:30:40.713
I'm the one
who sent him out there.


01:30:40.746 --> 01:30:42.548
-Can't let you do that.
-He needs my help.


01:30:42.581 --> 01:30:44.617
Bo know how to handle himself.


01:30:44.650 --> 01:30:46.552
Probably got in that car
and got someplace safe.


01:30:46.585 --> 01:30:47.920
Y'all ain't gonna keep me
from my husband.


01:30:47.954 --> 01:30:50.156
Grace, we tryin' to keep you
alive right now.


01:30:50.189 --> 01:30:51.991
We just gotta hole up
till sunrise.


01:30:52.725 --> 01:30:53.626
Okay?


01:30:56.629 --> 01:30:58.564
Now, we need...


01:30:58.597 --> 01:30:59.532
garlic...


01:31:01.600 --> 01:31:02.969
wood...


01:31:05.071 --> 01:31:07.173
...silver, and holy water.


01:31:07.206 --> 01:31:10.076
Shit might not kill 'em,
but it'll slow 'em down.


01:31:12.111 --> 01:31:14.246
How could it move
and sound like Stack...


01:31:15.181 --> 01:31:16.549
if it ain't Stack?


01:31:16.582 --> 01:31:18.217
I only ever heard stories.


01:31:18.250 --> 01:31:19.852
I ain't never come across
them myself.


01:31:19.885 --> 01:31:21.721
What stories
you heard?


01:31:21.754 --> 01:31:24.790
How haints work. They switch
places with the soul of a man.


01:31:26.225 --> 01:31:27.960
But vampires is different.


01:31:29.261 --> 01:31:31.797
<i>Maybe the worst kind.</i>


01:31:31.831 --> 01:31:34.133
The soul gets stuck
in the body.


01:31:34.166 --> 01:31:35.868
Can't rejoin the ancestors.


01:31:35.901 --> 01:31:38.270
Cursed to live here
with all this hate.


01:31:40.873 --> 01:31:43.109
Can't even feel
the warmth of a sunrise.


01:31:45.111 --> 01:31:46.612
Okay then.


01:31:46.645 --> 01:31:48.014
Can we bring him back?


01:31:48.047 --> 01:31:49.849
If I killed the ones
that made him this way...


01:31:49.882 --> 01:31:51.150
<i>Smoke...</i>


01:31:51.183 --> 01:31:52.218
<i>They have a connection,</i>


01:31:52.251 --> 01:31:53.786
<i>but they live on...</i>


01:31:53.819 --> 01:31:56.188
even if the one
that made them is killed.


01:31:56.222 --> 01:31:57.890
The best thing
we can do for him


01:31:57.923 --> 01:31:59.859
is free his spirit
from this curse.


01:31:59.892 --> 01:32:01.961
They gotta be killed,
one by one.


01:32:01.994 --> 01:32:03.562
And how the hell do we do that?


01:32:04.697 --> 01:32:05.765
Sunlight.


01:32:06.866 --> 01:32:08.267
A wooden stake to the heart.


01:32:10.302 --> 01:32:12.571
The hell, Annie?


01:32:12.605 --> 01:32:14.740
I kept that boy safe
all these years.


01:32:15.975 --> 01:32:17.810
<i>All over this world.</i>


01:32:17.843 --> 01:32:18.844
Why tonight?


01:32:20.079 --> 01:32:21.080
It's 'cause of me.


01:32:21.914 --> 01:32:23.983
My daddy told me.


01:32:24.016 --> 01:32:26.185
He said the devil was comin'
on account of my music.


01:32:26.218 --> 01:32:28.988
I had a gal once, vampire.


01:32:29.021 --> 01:32:30.956
She was light skinneded, too.


01:32:30.990 --> 01:32:32.958
That gal bit me
everywhere but my neck.


01:32:35.361 --> 01:32:37.730
Sammie...


01:32:37.763 --> 01:32:39.832
you don't worry
about a thing, hear?


01:32:39.865 --> 01:32:42.034
Devil done came
for me plenty of times.


01:32:42.068 --> 01:32:43.769
If he come knockin' tonight...


01:32:45.838 --> 01:32:48.808
he gonna have to go through
his old friend Delta Slim


01:32:48.841 --> 01:32:49.975
before he get to you.


01:32:50.009 --> 01:32:51.877
That go for everybody in here.


01:32:56.415 --> 01:32:58.784
If I get bit by one of them...


01:32:58.818 --> 01:33:00.886
promise me, right now...


01:33:00.920 --> 01:33:03.355
that you'll free me
'fore I turn.


01:33:03.389 --> 01:33:04.790
What you mean, "free you"?


01:33:07.860 --> 01:33:09.195
I got somebody
on the other side


01:33:09.228 --> 01:33:10.596
waitin' for me.


01:33:11.797 --> 01:33:13.232
They waitin' on you, too.


01:33:23.275 --> 01:33:24.877
You understand?


01:33:24.910 --> 01:33:26.212
Hey, come on, look at me.


01:33:26.245 --> 01:33:27.746
I don't care about
what that shit say.


01:33:27.780 --> 01:33:29.348
I'm gonna make sure
you get home safe.


01:33:29.381 --> 01:33:32.318
Sammie! Smoke!


01:33:32.351 --> 01:33:34.854
Well, who did this?
Was it Stack or Mary?


01:33:34.887 --> 01:33:36.155
Nah.


01:33:36.188 --> 01:33:37.690
They ran straight out.
You saw them.


01:33:37.723 --> 01:33:39.325
Well, who bit him, then?


01:33:39.358 --> 01:33:41.127
We gotta get him out
before he wakes up.


01:33:53.172 --> 01:33:54.306
Come on.


01:33:54.340 --> 01:33:56.041
You don't hear that?


01:33:56.075 --> 01:33:59.145
<i>♪ Leave where I was born ♪</i>


01:34:00.312 --> 01:34:02.047
They playin' music.


01:34:02.081 --> 01:34:05.784
<i>♪ I cut a stout blackthorn ♪</i>


01:34:08.087 --> 01:34:13.259
<i>♪ For to banish
Ghosts and goblins ♪</i>


01:34:13.292 --> 01:34:16.929
<i>♪ A brand-new pair of brogues ♪</i>


01:34:16.962 --> 01:34:21.100
<i>♪ To rattle over the bogs ♪</i>


01:34:21.133 --> 01:34:25.237
<i>-♪ And frighten all the dogs ♪
-Hey, hey.</i>


01:34:25.271 --> 01:34:26.872
Let's get back inside.


01:34:26.906 --> 01:34:27.306
<i>♪ On the rocky road
To Dublin ♪</i>


01:34:27.339 --> 01:34:28.841
Come on.


01:34:30.109 --> 01:34:33.045
<i>♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪</i>


01:34:35.047 --> 01:34:36.916
<i>♪ Well, in the merry month
Of May ♪</i>


01:34:36.949 --> 01:34:38.784
<i>♪ From me home I started ♪</i>


01:34:38.817 --> 01:34:40.819
<i>♪ Left the girls of Tuam
Nearly brokenhearted ♪</i>


01:34:40.853 --> 01:34:44.190
<i>♪ Saluted Father dear
Kissed me darling mother ♪</i>


01:34:44.223 --> 01:34:46.358
<i>♪ Drank a pint of beer
My grief and tears to smother ♪</i>


01:34:46.392 --> 01:34:49.228
<i>♪ Then off to reap the corn
Leave where I was born ♪</i>


01:34:49.261 --> 01:34:51.997
<i>♪ Cut a stout blackthorn
To banish ghosts and goblins ♪</i>


01:34:52.031 --> 01:34:54.733
<i>♪ Brand-new pair of brogues
Rattlin' over the bogs ♪</i>


01:34:54.767 --> 01:34:57.870
<i>♪ Frightened all the dogs
On the rocky road to Dublin ♪</i>


01:34:57.903 --> 01:34:59.805
<i>♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪</i>


01:34:59.838 --> 01:35:00.839
<i>♪ Hunt the Hare
And turn her down ♪</i>


01:35:00.873 --> 01:35:02.741
<i>♪ The rocky road ♪</i>


01:35:02.775 --> 01:35:04.910
<i>♪ And all the way to Dublin
Whack fol lol le rah! ♪</i>


01:35:04.944 --> 01:35:07.880
<i>♪ The boys of Liverpool
When we safely landed ♪</i>


01:35:07.913 --> 01:35:10.282
<i>♪ Called meself a fool
I could no longer stand it ♪</i>


01:35:10.316 --> 01:35:12.885
<i>♪ Me blood began to boil
Temper I was losing ♪</i>


01:35:12.918 --> 01:35:15.421
<i>♪ Poor old Erin's Isle
They began abusing ♪</i>


01:35:15.454 --> 01:35:18.257
<i>♪ "Hurrah me soul!" says I
Shillelagh I let fly ♪</i>


01:35:18.290 --> 01:35:21.293
<i>♪ Some Galway boys were nigh
And saw I was a-hobblin' ♪</i>


01:35:21.327 --> 01:35:24.163
<i>♪ With a loud "Hurray!"
Joined in the array ♪</i>


01:35:24.196 --> 01:35:26.265
<i>♪ We quickly cleared the way ♪</i>


01:35:26.298 --> 01:35:28.133
<i>♪ On the rocky road to Dublin
One, two, three, four, five ♪</i>


01:35:28.167 --> 01:35:29.835
<i>♪ Hunt the Hare
And turn her down ♪</i>


01:35:29.868 --> 01:35:31.538
<i>♪ The rocky road ♪</i>


01:35:31.571 --> 01:35:33.772
<i>♪ And all the way to Dublin
Whack fol lol le rah! ♪</i>


01:35:33.806 --> 01:35:35.140
<i>♪ Hunt the Hare
And turn her down ♪</i>


01:35:35.174 --> 01:35:37.042
<i>♪ The rocky road ♪</i>


01:35:37.076 --> 01:35:39.178
<i>♪ And all the way to Dublin
Whack fol lol le rah! ♪</i>


01:35:39.211 --> 01:35:40.379
<i>♪ Hunt the Hare
And turn her down ♪</i>


01:35:40.412 --> 01:35:42.281
<i>♪ The rocky road ♪</i>


01:35:42.314 --> 01:35:45.417
<i>♪ And all the way to Dublin
Whack fol lol le rah! ♪</i>


01:36:07.574 --> 01:36:09.975
We all gon' eat
this clove of garlic.


01:36:13.979 --> 01:36:16.849
I don't much like
the taste of it.


01:36:16.882 --> 01:36:19.184
Ain't no one saying
you gotta like it.


01:36:19.218 --> 01:36:20.386
We just gotta figure out


01:36:20.419 --> 01:36:22.054
if any of us left
is one of them.


01:36:32.931 --> 01:36:34.300
You don't got
none of the pickled ones?


01:36:39.071 --> 01:36:40.172
This is ridiculous.


01:36:43.610 --> 01:36:45.978
-Smoke, put the gun down.
-Shut up.


01:36:46.011 --> 01:36:48.548
Eat, or I'll shoot.


01:36:48.581 --> 01:36:50.482
Put the gun down, Smoke.
She ain't no damn vampire.


01:36:50.517 --> 01:36:51.850
How the hell
you know that?


01:36:51.884 --> 01:36:53.919
Just eat the damn garlic, girl.


01:36:53.952 --> 01:36:56.188
Smoke!


01:36:56.221 --> 01:36:57.456
I'm trying to
keep you alive, boy.


01:36:57.489 --> 01:36:58.991
You ain't to question me.


01:36:59.024 --> 01:37:00.292
You a evil man.


01:37:01.927 --> 01:37:04.029
No wonder
the devil come for us.


01:37:30.022 --> 01:37:32.057
- Mm-mm.
- Hey, Slim.


01:37:32.091 --> 01:37:33.292
What's goin' on, man?


01:37:35.562 --> 01:37:36.895
Mm-mm. Mm-mm.


01:37:36.929 --> 01:37:38.397
