You always did.


01:52:50.075 --> 01:52:52.945
We are earth and beast and God.


01:52:52.978 --> 01:52:55.014
We are woman and man.


01:52:55.047 --> 01:52:56.915
We are connected,
you and I...


01:52:59.184 --> 01:53:01.086
...to everything.


01:53:15.868 --> 01:53:17.169
Shit!


01:53:17.202 --> 01:53:18.904
No.


01:53:29.415 --> 01:53:32.885
You will taste
the sweet pain of death.


01:53:32.918 --> 01:53:38.090
We will make
beautiful music together.


01:53:52.672 --> 01:53:54.607
- He get you? Did he get you?
- No!


01:54:02.549 --> 01:54:03.916
I'm here. I'm here.


01:54:12.224 --> 01:54:13.492
- The sun!
- The sun!


01:55:20.192 --> 01:55:21.193
Want help?


01:55:32.137 --> 01:55:33.138
Go home.


01:55:35.007 --> 01:55:36.375
And bury that fuckin' guitar.


01:55:44.416 --> 01:55:45.384
I can't.


01:55:47.352 --> 01:55:48.555
It's Charley Patton's.


01:55:50.122 --> 01:55:51.123
What?


01:55:52.458 --> 01:55:53.726
Boy, who told you that?


01:55:58.263 --> 01:55:59.231
Stack.


01:56:01.333 --> 01:56:02.735
Said y'all won it off him.


01:56:06.405 --> 01:56:08.173
Lyin' son of a bitch.


01:56:10.577 --> 01:56:12.010
That's our daddy guitar.


01:56:14.480 --> 01:56:15.515
Hey. Come here.


01:56:17.216 --> 01:56:18.450
Be strong, you hear me?


01:56:20.219 --> 01:56:21.220
Hear me?


01:56:23.723 --> 01:56:25.357
I got some business to handle.


01:56:27.226 --> 01:56:28.494
Be strong.


01:56:28.528 --> 01:56:29.995
You hear?


01:56:58.257 --> 01:57:01.059
<i>♪ Little light of mine ♪</i>


01:57:01.093 --> 01:57:03.328
<i>♪ I'm gonna let it shine ♪</i>


01:57:05.330 --> 01:57:07.734
<i>♪ This little light of mine ♪</i>


01:58:33.452 --> 01:58:34.587
<i>And if we see you...</i>


01:58:34.621 --> 01:58:36.188
or any one of your Klan buddies


01:58:36.221 --> 01:58:38.625
cross our property line...


01:58:38.658 --> 01:58:40.325
<i>we gonna kill 'em
right where they stand.</i>


01:58:43.195 --> 01:58:44.931
Klan don't exist no more.


01:58:44.964 --> 01:58:46.799
Little coon huntin'
this morning, boys.


01:58:46.833 --> 01:58:48.668
Love skinnin' me
a nigger


01:58:48.701 --> 01:58:50.469
first thing of the day.


01:58:50.502 --> 01:58:52.270
Gettin' a little
too uppity around here.


01:58:52.304 --> 01:58:54.574
Time to teach
these boys a lesson.


01:58:54.607 --> 01:58:56.609
Club Juke, huh?


01:58:56.643 --> 01:58:59.411
Grand openin'
and grand closin'.


01:58:59.444 --> 01:59:01.413
- Let's do it. Open it up.
- Yeah.


01:59:06.586 --> 01:59:07.587
Sammie!


01:59:12.290 --> 01:59:13.291
Come, son.


01:59:18.898 --> 01:59:20.533
Door's locked.


01:59:20.566 --> 01:59:22.200
Try the front.


01:59:22.234 --> 01:59:23.670
Drop the guitar, Samuel.


01:59:26.438 --> 01:59:27.439
This one is, too.


01:59:29.542 --> 01:59:30.877
Where the hell
is it comin' from?


01:59:30.910 --> 01:59:32.244
Niggers is shootin' at us!


01:59:41.486 --> 01:59:42.655
Kill his Black ass!


02:00:01.841 --> 02:00:03.943
Drive!
Drive, damn it, drive!


02:00:46.919 --> 02:00:48.821
Drop the guitar, Samuel.


02:00:48.855 --> 02:00:49.856
Put it down.


02:00:49.889 --> 02:00:51.256
In the name of God.


02:00:52.959 --> 02:00:54.326
You tell them...


02:00:55.494 --> 02:00:56.629
<i>"my heart...</i>


02:00:57.930 --> 02:00:59.431
my voice...


02:01:00.398 --> 02:01:01.634
my soul...


02:01:02.602 --> 02:01:04.570
belongeth to the Lord."


02:01:06.773 --> 02:01:08.406
You got a cigarette?


02:01:08.440 --> 02:01:09.742
You go to hell, nigger.


02:02:03.830 --> 02:02:05.497
Hmm.


02:02:07.633 --> 02:02:09.802
Elijah.


02:02:09.836 --> 02:02:11.904
You put that cig out,
you can hold her.


02:02:19.579 --> 02:02:21.848
I don't want any of that smoke
to get on her.


02:02:32.758 --> 02:02:34.894
Hey. Listen...


02:02:37.163 --> 02:02:38.698
I got money. Huh?


02:03:26.913 --> 02:03:28.114
Papa's here.


02:05:35.875 --> 02:05:37.043
Hey, boss...


02:05:37.076 --> 02:05:38.244
we got two out there.


02:05:38.277 --> 02:05:39.745
I told 'em we closed,


02:05:39.779 --> 02:05:41.247
but they offered
a couple hundred bucks.


02:05:41.280 --> 02:05:42.681
-That okay with you?
-That don't bother me none.


02:05:45.951 --> 02:05:47.586
Come on in.


02:06:06.272 --> 02:06:08.007
Vampires is different.


02:06:08.040 --> 02:06:10.643
<i>Maybe the worst kind.</i>


02:06:10.676 --> 02:06:12.111
<i>But they live on,</i>


02:06:12.144 --> 02:06:14.713
<i>even if the one
that made them is killed.</i>


02:06:14.747 --> 02:06:17.283
<i>They gotta be killed,
one by one.</i>


02:06:22.088 --> 02:06:23.889
I'll have
whatever the old man havin'.


02:06:42.274 --> 02:06:43.309
Hm.


02:06:47.379 --> 02:06:49.081
How?


02:06:49.115 --> 02:06:51.717
I guess I was the one person
he just couldn't kill.


02:06:51.750 --> 02:06:54.286
<i>He made me promise
to stay away from you.</i>


02:06:54.320 --> 02:06:55.921
Let you live out your life.


02:07:06.966 --> 02:07:08.400
It won't be long for you, huh?


02:07:11.403 --> 02:07:13.939
I could make it
so that you could stick around.


02:07:13.973 --> 02:07:15.074
Keep tourin'.


02:07:15.975 --> 02:07:16.976
Keep livin'.


02:07:17.943 --> 02:07:18.944
No pain.


02:07:21.881 --> 02:07:23.949
I think I've seen
enough of this place.


02:07:25.718 --> 02:07:27.953
Hm.


02:07:27.987 --> 02:07:30.856
You know, we got every
single one of your records.


02:07:30.890 --> 02:07:32.091
I don't like that electric shit


02:07:32.124 --> 02:07:33.759
as much as the real.


02:07:33.792 --> 02:07:35.094
Yeah.


02:07:35.127 --> 02:07:37.897
I miss the real.


02:07:37.930 --> 02:07:40.199
Recordings from back then
sound like a pile of dogshit.


02:07:43.235 --> 02:07:44.670
How about it, Sammie?


02:07:46.772 --> 02:07:48.107
You still got the real in you?


02:08:11.864 --> 02:08:14.767
<i>♪ Travelin' ♪</i>


02:08:16.802 --> 02:08:20.339
<i>♪ I don't know why in the hell
I'm out here ♪</i>


02:08:28.247 --> 02:08:32.017
<i>♪ Travelin' ♪</i>


02:08:32.051 --> 02:08:35.421
<i>♪ I don't know why in the hell
I'm here ♪</i>


02:08:43.162 --> 02:08:46.865
<i>♪ Because the woman
I'm lovin' ♪</i>


02:08:46.899 --> 02:08:50.269
<i>♪ You know she really
She really don't care ♪</i>


02:08:50.302 --> 02:08:51.770
No, she don't.


02:09:11.824 --> 02:09:13.225
Take care, little Sammie.


02:09:17.564 --> 02:09:18.531
You know something?


02:09:24.470 --> 02:09:27.540
Maybe once a week,
I wake up paralyzed...


02:09:28.608 --> 02:09:30.042
reliving that night.


02:09:32.111 --> 02:09:33.946
But before the sun went down...


02:09:36.048 --> 02:09:38.183
I think that was the best day
of my life.


02:09:40.452 --> 02:09:41.954
Was it like that for you?


02:09:46.292 --> 02:09:47.493
No doubt about it.


02:09:49.428 --> 02:09:50.929
Last time I seen my brother.


02:09:52.398 --> 02:09:53.533
I love you.


02:09:55.067 --> 02:09:56.268
Last time I seen the sun.


02:09:59.238 --> 02:10:00.906
And just for a few hours...


02:10:03.042 --> 02:10:04.109
we was free.


02:16:22.454 --> 02:16:25.925
<i>♪ This little light of mine ♪</i>


02:16:28.795 --> 02:16:32.364
<i>♪ I'm gonna let it shine ♪</i>


02:16:36.869 --> 02:16:38.705
<i>♪ Yeah ♪</i>


02:16:38.738 --> 02:16:40.740
<i>♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪</i>


02:16:44.911 --> 02:16:47.747
<i>♪ This little light of mine ♪</i>


02:16:49.749 --> 02:16:52.885
<i>♪ I'm gonna let it shine ♪</i>


02:16:52.919 --> 02:16:54.453
<i>♪ Let it shine ♪</i>


02:16:55.655 --> 02:16:57.255
<i>♪ Yeah ♪</i>


02:16:57.289 --> 02:16:58.925
<i>♪ Oh, let it shine ♪</i>


02:17:04.362 --> 02:17:06.566
<i>♪ Everywhere I go ♪</i>


02:17:09.001 --> 02:17:11.068
<i>♪ Gonna let it shine ♪</i>

